      "id": "team-h01-support-branches",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "query": "We need a full support operation. 1) Read the shared inbox. 2) Classify every email. 3) If a ticket is urgent (outage, data loss, security), page the on-call engineer. 4) Otherwise draft a reply. 5) Translate replies for non-English customers. 6) Before anything goes out, a reviewer checks the reply for tone and promises. 7) Log every interaction in the CRM. 8) Send a weekly CSAT report. 9) Keep a planner tracking open work. 10) Track SLA breaches. We know a team is capped, so if you cannot fit everything, the non-negotiables are: the triage/routing step, the reply drafter, the reviewer gate on every reply, and paging on-call for urgent tickets. The triage step decides between the urgent path and the reply path.",
      "mustIncludeAny": [
        "rv-inbox-triage",
        "rv-urgency-router"
      ],
      "requiredGroups": [
